{"id":"2c13047d-9f5b-4070-b2e9-9ad8c363bff0","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"2ad37968dce0d78b","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/previews/page-script.ts","baseline":{"blob":"3ec1f52f427205c6af15c11dbeecb878e13b7fc9","start":935,"end":1416},"shape":{"type":"FunctionDeclaration","atoms":["function","host","(",")",":","Window","|","undefined","{","const","mine","=","/","\\/__virtual__\\/[^/]+\\/\\d+","/","u",".","exec","(","location",".","pathname",")","?.","[","0","]",";","let","current",":","Window","=","window",";","if","(","mine","===","undefined",")","{","return","undefined",";","}","try","{","while","(","current",".","parent","!==","current","&&","current",".","parent",".","location",".","pathname",".","includes","(","mine",")",")","{","current","=","current",".","parent",";","}","}","catch","{","}","return","current",".","parent","===","current","?","undefined",":","current",".","parent",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"f5c686aefc4cf2c0","after":"7e3453e1a1f2892f"}},"payload":{"text":"The window the preview's top frame is in: above every frame of this dev server's (its pages are under\n`/__virtual__/<tab>/<port>/`), the first that isn't.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:36.942Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:36.942Z"}
{"id":"2c5811b4-f940-4377-b5c2-2cba08ba5c1b","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7a30343f46d35243","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/previews/page-script.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b4617abbdc964c0afbc3d0462b4a2d64bb5b0bf0","start":2084,"end":2246},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["addEventListener","(","\"","message","\"",",","(","event",":","MessageEvent",")","=>","{","if","(","(","event",".","data","as","{","\"","channel","\"","?",":","unknown","}","|","null",")","?.","channel","===","`","","${","CHANNEL","}","-flush","`",")","{","flush","(",")",";","}","}",")"]},"context":{"before":"89e442a2cb9eb993"}},"payload":{"text":"The editor asks every page of a server to report now, as the server's run ends (its windows may stay open).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:36.484Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:36.484Z"}
{"id":"38162353-64cc-4855-a916-f28a2146da3c","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"f5c686aefc4cf2c0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/previews/page-script.ts","baseline":{"blob":"925cc824419e14ba2809a79df35fa59850a5e9ed","start":845,"end":881},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","STOPS_CHANNEL","=","\"","editor-stops","\""]},"context":{"before":"db17f699e7936814","after":"2ad37968dce0d78b"}},"payload":{"text":"And what a report of its recorded stops is.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:37.355Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:37.355Z"}
{"id":"439a6e81-660e-4254-b5c2-a00e3ccb53d8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"e07d531196fe5400","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/previews/page-script.ts","baseline":{"blob":"15979ffa236ca6d58ef8ccfe86c9c5d0742169f6","start":0,"end":53},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","{","installPageEvidence","}","from","\"","./page-evidence","\""]},"context":{"after":"db17f699e7936814"}},"payload":{"text":"The script a dev server puts first in every page it serves while it's instrumenting (workers/node-worker.ts), so it's\nthere before the app's modules run: runtime evidence's page runtime (page-evidence.ts), reporting to the editor showing\nthe preview. A report goes to the window the preview's top frame is in (the shell's preview window: its frames are\nthe dev server's, everything above them isn't), which passes it on as `evidence.preview` (shell/preview-windows.tsx); and\nnow, when the editor asks (`evidence.flush`, as its server's run ends). And its recorded stops (a breakpoint in a page's\ncode: RUNNING.md), soon after each is hit, passed on as `stops.preview`.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:38.201Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:38.201Z"}
{"id":"c21ff810-7a72-4001-b80c-7e5b12b2660a","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"db17f699e7936814","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/previews/page-script.ts","baseline":{"blob":"6cab26a5f9bd1dce3621be830155acb3ecc7ead9","start":751,"end":784},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","CHANNEL","=","\"","editor-evidence","\""]},"context":{"before":"e07d531196fe5400","after":"f5c686aefc4cf2c0"}},"payload":{"text":"What a report is to the window hosting the preview.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:37.790Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:56:37.790Z"}
